{"book":"judges","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T07:40:48.340723292Z","verse":31,"ref":"judges 6:31","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":6,"translation":"And Joash said to all who had gathered against him, \"Will ⟨you⟩ plead the case for Baal? Or will ⟨you⟩ save him? Whoever pleads for him shall be put to death by the morning. If ⟨he⟩ is Elohim, let him plead for himself — for he has torn down ⟨את⟩ his altar.\"","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And he said"},{"surface":"יואש","gloss":"Joash"},{"surface":"לכל","gloss":"to all"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"who"},{"surface":"עמדו","gloss":"had gathered"},{"surface":"עליו","gloss":"against him"},{"surface":"האתם","gloss":"Will ⟨you⟩"},{"surface":"תריבון","gloss":"plead the case"},{"surface":"לבעל","gloss":"for Baal"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"Or"},{"surface":"אתם","gloss":"will ⟨you⟩"},{"surface":"תושיעון","gloss":"save"},{"surface":"אותו","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"him"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"Whoever"},{"surface":"יריב","gloss":"pleads for"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"him"},{"surface":"יומת","gloss":"shall be put to death"},{"surface":"עד","gloss":"by"},{"surface":"הבקר","gloss":"the morning"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"If"},{"surface":"אלהים","gloss":"Elohim"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"⟨he⟩ is"},{"surface":"ירב","gloss":"let him plead"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"for himself"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"נתץ","gloss":"he has torn down"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"his altar"},{"surface":"מזבחו","gloss":"his altar"}]}